  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_001",
    "text": "**NovaCore Technologies Pvt. Ltd.  \nEXPENSE POLICY**\n\n| **Document ID**      | FIN-POL-002                               |\n|----------------------|-------------------------------------------|\n| **Department**       | Finance                                   |\n| **Document Type**    | Policy                                    |\n| **Policy Title**     | Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy |\n| **Version**          | 2026                                      |\n| **Effective Date**   | 01-Apr-2026                               |\n| **Owner Department** | Finance                                   |",
    "metadata": {
