      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "Document Introduction",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_001"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_002",
    "text": "This policy defines eligible employee expenses, reimbursement limits, approval requirements, supporting documentation, and reimbursement procedures.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "1. Purpose",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_002"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_003",
    "text": "The policy applies to employees incurring legitimate business expenses on behalf of NovaCore Technologies Pvt. Ltd.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "2. Scope",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_003"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_004",
    "text": "Expenses must be business-related, reasonable, documented, within applicable limits, and submitted within the required timeline.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "3. General Principles",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_004"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_005",
    "text": "| **Expense Category**   | **Maximum Reimbursement Limit**   | **Notes**                                         |\n|------------------------|-----------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|\n| Hotel                  | ₹6,000 per night                  | Business travel; supporting invoice required      |\n| Meals                  | ₹1,500 per day                    | Business travel or approved business activity     |\n| Local Transport        | ₹1,000 per day                    | Business-related local travel                     |\n| Client Entertainment   | ₹3,000 per person                 | Business purpose and participant details required |\n| Miscellaneous          | ₹5,000 per claim                  | Must be business-related and justified            |",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "4. Expense Categories and Limits",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_005"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_006",
    "text": "Claims up to ₹25,000 require manager approval. Claims from ₹25,001 to ₹1,00,000 require Department Head approval. Claims above ₹1,00,000 require Finance Controller approval.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "5. Approval Requirements",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_006"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_007",
    "text": "Employees must submit claims within 15 calendar days of the expense date.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "6. Submission Deadline",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_007"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_008",
    "text": "Valid invoices, receipts, travel records, participant details where applicable, and business justification must accompany claims.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "7. Supporting Documentation",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_008"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_009",
    "text": "The employee submits the claim; the designated approver reviews it; Finance validates compliance; approved claims are processed.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "8. Reimbursement Process",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_009"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_010",
    "text": "Personal expenses, unsupported expenses, expenses outside limits without an authorized exception, penalties or fines, and unrelated expenses are not reimbursable.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "9. Non-Reimbursable Expenses",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_010"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_011",
    "text": "Exceptional expenses may be considered with documented business justification and appropriate approval.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "10. Exceptions",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_011"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_012",
    "text": "Employees submit accurate claims. Managers and Department Heads review business necessity. Finance validates compliance and reimbursement eligibility.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "11. Responsibilities",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_012"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_013",
    "text": "Expense claims and supporting records must be retained for 7 years unless a longer period is required.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "Finance",
      "document_name": "Expense_Policy",
      "document_type": "DOCX",
      "source_file": "data/raw/Finance/Expense_Policy.docx",
      "policy_title": "Employee Expense and Reimbursement Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "Finance",
      "document_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY",
      "section": "12. Record Retention",
      "chunk_id": "FINANCE_EXPENSE_POLICY_CHUNK_013"
    }
  },
  {
